          "title": "Attack",
          "text": "Your wall is ready. Attack the thief's board or their hero. They only have 10 life.",
          "require": "attack"
        },
        {
          "id": "free",
          "title": "Hold the nave",
          "text": "Spend energy, attack, end turn. Reduce Night Thief to 0.",
          "require": "free"
        }
      ],
